  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Environment: \nClimate Change and Carbon Neutrality'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Risk: \n•\tClimate change–driven extreme weather can endanger people while disrupting business continuity through physical damage, strategic challenges, and evolving regulatory and market conditions.\n•\tIncreasing global carbon pricing mechanisms and India’s evolving green credit obligations pose financial & operational risks. High dependence on the grid power may lead to Scope 2 volatility.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'LTM is advancing a globally aligned climate strategy to mitigate environmental risks and enhance long‑term resilience, integrating energy efficiency, scaled renewable energy adoption, responsible water management, and rigorous climate risk assessment into its business model.\n\nWe are advancing a science-led decarbonization pathway through the Science based target initiatives. We are transitioning to renewable resources to meet our internal power requirement. We utilize IoT-based energy management systems to optimize HVAC and server load in our delivery centers. \n\nWe invested INR 1840.33 million in green building infrastructure in FY26. This includes smart metering and BMS enabled controls.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Environment: \nClimate Change and Carbon Neutrality'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Opportunity: \n•\tInvesting in LEED certified and high efficiency buildings to future proof assets and align with global ESG leadership standards.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'LTM is advancing a globally aligned climate strategy to mitigate environmental risks and enhance long‑term resilience, integrating energy efficiency, scaled renewable energy adoption, responsible water management, and rigorous climate risk assessment into its business model.\n\nWe are advancing a science-led decarbonization pathway through the Science based target initiatives. We are transitioning to renewable resources to meet our internal power requirement. We utilize IoT-based energy management systems to optimize HVAC and server load in our delivery centers. \n\nWe invested INR 1840.33 million in green building infrastructure in FY26. This includes smart metering and BMS enabled controls.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues2)"
