  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Risk:\n•\tOperations in water stressed regions (Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai).\n•\tDisruption in municipal supply or groundwater depletion directly threatens facility operations.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'We ensure 100% recycling of treated wastewater through advanced STPs for flushing and landscaping. We have installed smart water meters, smart cleaning programs, onsite RO plants and have implemented extensive rainwater harvesting structures.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues3)"
  },
