  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Opportunity:\n•\tTransitioning from liner to circular resource use reduces the environmental footprint of our offices and supports sustainable procurement.'.",
