  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Aiming for ~100% waste recycling by 2030. Partnering with authorized recyclers and implementing sustainable procurement where materials are returned to partners for refurbishment.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Social: Employee Wellbeing and Experience'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Risk:\n•\tShortage of multi-skilled talent in the market, driven by rapid technological advancements, can threaten LTM’s competitiveness.\n•\tFailing to provide a safe and inclusive workspace can negatively impact employee morale, productivity, and the company's reputation, while also hindering efforts to attract and retain talent.\n•\tHigher attrition and losing talent have an impact on customer relations, execution, loss of institutional knowledge and increased costs.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Learning and Development (Shoshin School):\n\nA structured learning ecosystem is established to enable continuous capability development, enhance workforce readiness and align employee skills with evolving business requirements.\n\n•\tLTM is committed to fostering a culture of continuous learning and professional development among its workforces. The company offers a variety of skill enhancement programs that addresses technical skills, industry knowledge, and in the emerging technologies that also involves bridging Technology and Domain. These initiatives are designed to empower employees to thrive in a rapidly changing business environment.\n\n•\tShoshin School promotes ongoing learning and development of employees at LTM. The programs offered to lateral, and college graduate hires are structured to accelerate project readiness, ensuring employees can quickly upskill /reskill and contribute to organizational goals.\n\n•\tTo further promote the culture of lifelong learning and innovation, the Learning Promenade initiative offered by Shoshin School provides opportunities for employees to continually expand their knowledge and skills in emerging technology trends. Initiatives such as these not only enrich individual capabilities but also drive transformative impact across the organization.\n\nStructured proctored assessments identify areas for improvement basis which customized training plan is offered aligning to the business needs.\n\nWellbeing:\n•\tRecognizing that Wellbeing encompasses all aspects of life, LTM promotes holistic wellbeing through quarterly programs focused on physical, emotional, financial, and social health. Associates benefit from initiatives that support the adaptation to hybrid work and work-life balance, reinforcing the organization's trust in its people to manage their well-being in ways that suit their unique needs. Our associates also have access to 24/7 medical assistance, including audio/video consultations with general physicians and specialists, which is free for associates and their five dependents in India. Other medical services are available at discounted rates. \n\nEmployee Retention:\n•\tAssured Engagement Framework with enhanced focus on Rewards and Recognitions.\n•\tHolistic Career Management through defined career paths for growth and upskilling.\n•\tLeadership development program – Customized and standardized.\n•\tBalanced Workplace flexibility.\n•\tDifferentiated employee value proposition.\n•\tEngaging campus involvement programs.\n•\tOpportunity vs. Aspiration matrix is implemented via Talent Central.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Social: Employee Wellbeing and Experience'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Opportunity:\n•\tLTM integrates wellness facilities across its locations to attract and retain top talent, boosting employee satisfaction, productivity, and innovation, thereby maintaining a competitive edge.\n•\tBy continuously monitoring the evolving job market, we ensure our strategies remain ahead of the curve, establishing us as the ‘Employer of Choice’ for both new talent and seasoned professionals.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Learning and Development (Shoshin School):\n\nA structured learning ecosystem is established to enable continuous capability development, enhance workforce readiness and align employee skills with evolving business requirements.\n\n•\tLTM is committed to fostering a culture of continuous learning and professional development among its workforces. The company offers a variety of skill enhancement programs that addresses technical skills, industry knowledge, and in the emerging technologies that also involves bridging Technology and Domain. These initiatives are designed to empower employees to thrive in a rapidly changing business environment.\n\n•\tShoshin School promotes ongoing learning and development of employees at LTM. The programs offered to lateral, and college graduate hires are structured to accelerate project readiness, ensuring employees can quickly upskill /reskill and contribute to organizational goals.\n\n•\tTo further promote the culture of lifelong learning and innovation, the Learning Promenade initiative offered by Shoshin School provides opportunities for employees to continually expand their knowledge and skills in emerging technology trends. Initiatives such as these not only enrich individual capabilities but also drive transformative impact across the organization.\n\nStructured proctored assessments identify areas for improvement basis which customized training plan is offered aligning to the business needs.\n\nWellbeing:\n•\tRecognizing that Wellbeing encompasses all aspects of life, LTM promotes holistic wellbeing through quarterly programs focused on physical, emotional, financial, and social health. Associates benefit from initiatives that support the adaptation to hybrid work and work-life balance, reinforcing the organization's trust in its people to manage their well-being in ways that suit their unique needs. Our associates also have access to 24/7 medical assistance, including audio/video consultations with general physicians and specialists, which is free for associates and their five dependents in India. Other medical services are available at discounted rates. \n\nEmployee Retention:\n•\tAssured Engagement Framework with enhanced focus on Rewards and Recognitions.\n•\tHolistic Career Management through defined career paths for growth and upskilling.\n•\tLeadership development program – Customized and standardized.\n•\tBalanced Workplace flexibility.\n•\tDifferentiated employee value proposition.\n•\tEngaging campus involvement programs.\n•\tOpportunity vs. Aspiration matrix is implemented via Talent Central.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Social: Community Development'.",
