  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Risk:\n•\tFailure to meet CSR goals can hinder the development of communities and compliance with regulatory requirements.'.",
