  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'We partner with a network of NGOs across various regions to promote social transformation through integrated models of sustainable change. Additionally, we establish systematic due diligence and employ evaluation processes to guarantee strategic investments in appropriate projects and areas.'.",
