  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Opportunity\n•\tA strong emphasis on ethics, integrity, and transparent governance enables effective mitigation of legal, regulatory, and compliance risks. \n•\tOur robust corporate governance framework fosters high standards of transparency, accountability, and responsible decision making, thereby strengthening stakeholder confidence and supporting sustainable value creation.'.",
