  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WebLinkOfEqualOppertunityPolicyTextBlock' (WebLinkOfEqualOppertunityPolicyTextBlock) is 'https://www.ltm.com/content/dam/ltimcorporatewebsite/uploads/investors/2022/11/Equal-Opportunity-Policy-.pdf'.",
