  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSafetyRelatedIncidentsOnAssessmentOfValueChainPartnersExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSafetyRelatedIncidentsOnAssessmentOfValueChainPartnersExplanatoryTextBlock) is '0% of our Value Chain Partners are assessed on health and safety practices and working conditions. Accordingly, no corrective actions were required.'.",
