  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoYouHaveAFocalPointResponsibleForAddressingHumanRightsImpactsOrIssuesCausedOrContributedToByTheBusiness' (DoYouHaveAFocalPointResponsibleForAddressingHumanRightsImpactsOrIssuesCausedOrContributedToByTheBusiness) is 'true'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoYouHaveAFocalPointResponsibleForAddressingHumanRightsImpactsOrIssuesCausedOrContributedToByTheBusiness, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DescribeTheInternalMechanismsInPlaceToRedressGrievancesRelatedToHumanRightsIssuesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DescribeTheInternalMechanismsInPlaceToRedressGrievancesRelatedToHumanRightsIssuesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'We encourage employees to report any suspected unethical practices or violations directly at whistleblower@ltm.com. We have implemented the Prevention of Sexual Harassment (POSH) Policy to ensure adherence to applicable laws and promote a culture of respect and inclusivity.\nOur reporting procedures extend globally, employees have access to the Grievance Redressal portal to raise concerns, and our Grievance Redressal Policy encourages employees to report issues which will be addressed promptly, fairly, and impartially by dedicated teams. All reported concerns are managed with sensitivity and undergo an investigation process. Appropriate actions, with timely and thorough resolutions including disciplinary measures, are taken where necessary, and seek regulatory assistance as needed. These mechanisms ensure a fair and responsive approach to addressing grievances.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DescribeTheInternalMechanismsInPlaceToRedressGrievancesRelatedToHumanRightsIssuesExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NumberOfComplaintsFiledDuringTheYear' (NumberOfComplaintsFiledDuringTheYear) is '14' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: NumberOfComplaintsFiledDuringTheYear, Context: D_NumberOfComplaintsFiledDuringTheYear_1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[As of 2026-03-31] Fact: The value for 'NumberOfComplaintsPendingResolutionAtTheEndOfYear' (NumberOfComplaintsPendingResolutionAtTheEndOfYear) is '3' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: NumberOfComplaintsPendingResolutionAtTheEndOfYear, Context: I_NumberOfComplaintsPendingResolutionAtTheEndOfYear_1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RemarksforComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock' (RemarksforComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock) is '14(fourteen) cases were reported in FY 2025-26, out of which 13 (thirteen) pertain to India jurisdiction and 1 (one) was reported outside India which was covered under the LTM POSH policy but not covered under the POSH Redressal Act of India. \n\tOut of the 13 (Thirteen) cases reported in India, 11 (Eleven) were closed and review of 2 (two) cases are in progress. \n\tOut of the 11 (Eleven) cases closed in India, 9 (nine) were substantiated and 2 (two) were not substantiated. Necessary disciplinary actions are taken based on the recommendation of IC for substantiated cases.\n\t1 (one) case reported outside India is under review. \n\t1(one) case carried forwarded from FY 2024-25 (reported in India), was closed and not substantiated.\n\t12 (twelve) cases closed in FY 25-26 out of which 11 were reported in FY 25- 26 and 1(one) case carried forward from FY 24-25.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RemarksforComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: D_RemarksforComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock_1)"
  },
