  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSignificantRisksOrConcernsArisingFromTheAssessmentsOfPlantAndOfficeExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSignificantRisksOrConcernsArisingFromTheAssessmentsOfPlantAndOfficeExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'During fiscal year 2025-26, there were no significant incidents, and hence no corrective measures related to the above assessment.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSignificantRisksOrConcernsArisingFromTheAssessmentsOfPlantAndOfficeExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfABusinessProcessBeingModifiedOrIntroducedAsAResultOfAddressingHumanRightsGrievancesOrComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfABusinessProcessBeingModifiedOrIntroducedAsAResultOfAddressingHumanRightsGrievancesOrComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'We have not received any human rights complaints, and we regularly update our policies to prevent issues. Vendors and partners must comply with our Code of Conduct, Supplier Code of Conduct, and POSH policies, ensuring strong human rights practices throughout our value chain.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfABusinessProcessBeingModifiedOrIntroducedAsAResultOfAddressingHumanRightsGrievancesOrComplaintsExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfTheScopeAndCoverageOfAnyHumanRightsDueDiligenceConductedExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfTheScopeAndCoverageOfAnyHumanRightsDueDiligenceConductedExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'The already established grievance redressal process is periodically reviewed and strengthened to address human rights concerns effectively. The updated framework provides clearer escalation mechanisms, structured committee-based reviews, and defined closure timelines to ensure fair, timely, and consistent resolution of grievances, including those related to workplace conduct and employee rights.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfTheScopeAndCoverageOfAnyHumanRightsDueDiligenceConductedExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
