  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NameOfTheExternalAgencyThatUndertookIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceRelatedToWasteManagementExplanatoryTextBlock' (NameOfTheExternalAgencyThatUndertookIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceRelatedToWasteManagementExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'BDO India Services Private Limited.'.",
