    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WhetherAnyIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceHasBeenCarriedOutByAnExternalAgencyForTotalScope3Emissions' (WhetherAnyIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceHasBeenCarriedOutByAnExternalAgencyForTotalScope3Emissions) is 'true'.",
