  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NameOfTheExternalAgencyThatUndertookIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceForTotalScope3EmissionsExplanatoryTextBlock' (NameOfTheExternalAgencyThatUndertookIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceForTotalScope3EmissionsExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'BDO India Services Private Limited.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: NameOfTheExternalAgencyThatUndertookIndependentAssessmentOrEvaluationOrAssuranceForTotalScope3EmissionsExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Not applicable. LTM exclusively operates within government-approved industrial zones, ensuring that its facilities are situated away from ecologically sensitive areas. Analysis through various assessment tools such as the World Wildlife Fund’s Biodiversity Risk Filter (WWF-BRF) and MOEFCC Wetland Portal indicates that all the LTM campuses are distantly located from any of the protected areas including marine coral reefs, eco-sensitive zones, reserve/ protected forest, national parks, wetlands, sanctuaries, and areas of high biodiversity values, etc.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityHaveABusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlan' (DoesTheEntityHaveABusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlan) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityHaveABusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlan, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[As of 2026-03-31] Fact: The value for 'DisclosureWebLinkOfEntityAtWhichBusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlanIsPlaced' (DisclosureWebLinkOfEntityAtWhichBusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlanIsPlaced) is 'LTM has an established Business Continuity and Disaster Management framework aligned to ISO 22301:2019. The framework includes systematic identification, assessment, and management of environmental and external risk scenarios such as natural disasters and climate induced disruptions. The Business Continuity & Resilience Policy and supporting manuals define recovery strategies, roles, and periodic testing to minimize impact on operations and surrounding ecosystems during disruptive events. Recovery measures include remote working, alternate delivery locations, and optimized resource utilization. All continuity plans are governed, reviewed, and tested through iBCM, LTM’s in house Business Continuity Management lifecycle implementation platform.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DisclosureWebLinkOfEntityAtWhichBusinessContinuityAndDisasterManagementPlanIsPlaced, Context: ICYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DiscloseAnySignificantAdverseImpactToTheEnvironmentArisingFromTheValueChainOfTheEntityWhatMitigationOrAdaptationMeasuresHaveBeenTakenByTheEntityInThisRegardExplanatoryTextBlock' (DiscloseAnySignificantAdverseImpactToTheEnvironmentArisingFromTheValueChainOfTheEntityWhatMitigationOrAdaptationMeasuresHaveBeenTakenByTheEntityInThisRegardExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'No significant adverse environmental impacts arising from the Company’s value chain were identified during the reporting period. LTM has established robust mitigation and preventive controls through its Supplier Code of Conduct (SCoC), which sets clear expectations on environmental compliance, health and safety, labour standards, and adherence to applicable sustainability criteria. As part of the initial empanelment process, all new vendors and service providers are required to sign the SCOC document.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DiscloseAnySignificantAdverseImpactToTheEnvironmentArisingFromTheValueChainOfTheEntityWhatMitigationOrAdaptationMeasuresHaveBeenTakenByTheEntityInThisRegardExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfValueChainPartnersByValueOfBusinessDoneWithSuchPartnersThatWereAssessedForEnvironmentalImpacts' (PercentageOfValueChainPartnersByValueOfBusinessDoneWithSuchPartnersThatWereAssessedForEnvironmentalImpacts) is '0' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfValueChainPartnersByValueOfBusinessDoneWithSuchPartnersThatWereAssessedForEnvironmentalImpacts, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NumberOfGreenCreditsHaveBeenGeneratedOrProcuredByTheListedEntity' (NumberOfGreenCreditsHaveBeenGeneratedOrProcuredByTheListedEntity) is '0' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: NumberOfGreenCreditsHaveBeenGeneratedOrProcuredByTheListedEntity, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
