  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InitiativeUndertaken' (InitiativeUndertaken) is 'Energy Conservation programs'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InitiativeUndertaken, Context: D_SpecificInitiatives1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WebLinkForDetailsOfInitiativeTakenByEntity' (WebLinkForDetailsOfInitiativeTakenByEntity) is '•\tEnergy Efficient High-Speed Hand Dryers\n•\tEV Charging Infrastructure\n•\tDaylight Sensor Installation\n•\tLED Lighting Upgrades (Multiple Sites)\n•\tSmart Kitchen Exhaust Automation\n•\tUPS & Battery Room Cooling Optimization\n•\tHVAC Scheduling & Set Point Optimization\n•\tECM Blower Motor Upgrade (AHUs)\n•\tUPS Alarm Annunciator System\n•\tLighting Automation (Weekend Shutdowns)\n•\tUPS Capacity Optimization\n•\tModular UPS Upgrade\n•\tPrecision Air Conditioning (PAC) – Data Centre\n• Standalone AC for 24×7 Zones'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WebLinkForDetailsOfInitiativeTakenByEntity, Context: D_SpecificInitiatives1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'OutcomeOfTheInitiative' (OutcomeOfTheInitiative) is 'Energy savings: 15,50,420 kWh/annum\nEmission Reduced: 1099 tCO₂e /annum'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: OutcomeOfTheInitiative, Context: D_SpecificInitiatives1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'CorrectiveActionTakenForInitiative' (CorrectiveActionTakenForInitiative) is 'Nil'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: CorrectiveActionTakenForInitiative, Context: D_SpecificInitiatives1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InitiativeUndertaken' (InitiativeUndertaken) is 'Emission Reduction programs'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InitiativeUndertaken, Context: D_SpecificInitiatives2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'WebLinkForDetailsOfInitiativeTakenByEntity' (WebLinkForDetailsOfInitiativeTakenByEntity) is '•\tOn Site RO Plant Installation\n•\tInstallation of RECD in DG\n•Sustainable Mobility'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WebLinkForDetailsOfInitiativeTakenByEntity, Context: D_SpecificInitiatives2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'OutcomeOfTheInitiative' (OutcomeOfTheInitiative) is '•\tThe project avoids approximately 354 kg CO₂e annually.\n•\tThis resulted in 83% reduction in particulate matter and an 87% reduction in carbon monoxide, without causing any adverse effects on the Genset.\n• During the year, 61.57% of employee commute was enabled through cleaner fuel alternatives, comprising 55.31% Compressed Natural Gas (CNG) and 6.26% Electric Vehicle (EV) adoption. This transition significantly reduces transport‑related emissions while improving fuel efficiency and air quality in the communities where we operate.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: OutcomeOfTheInitiative, Context: D_SpecificInitiatives2)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'CorrectiveActionTakenForInitiative' (CorrectiveActionTakenForInitiative) is 'Nil'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: CorrectiveActionTakenForInitiative, Context: D_SpecificInitiatives2)"
  },
