  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MethodResortedForSuchAdvocacy' (MethodResortedForSuchAdvocacy) is 'The UN Global Compact Network India (UN GCNI), registered in 2003 as a non-profit society to function as the Indian Country Network of the Global Compact, New York. It is the first Country Network in the world to be established for businesses, civil organizations, public and private sector, aids in aligning stakeholders' responsible practices towards the Ten Universally Accepted Principles of UNGC, broad goals including Sustainable Development Goals and other key sister initiatives of the United Nations and its systems'.",
