  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayOnIssuesRelatingToAdvertisingAndDeliveryOfEssentialServicesOrCyberSecurityAndDataPrivacyOrRecallsOrPenaltyOrActionTakenByRegulatoryAuthoritiesOnSafetyOfProductsOrServicesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayOnIssuesRelatingToAdvertisingAndDeliveryOfEssentialServicesOrCyberSecurityAndDataPrivacyOrRecallsOrPenaltyOrActionTakenByRegulatoryAuthoritiesOnSafetyOfProductsOrServicesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'There were no reported concerns during the reporting period.'.",
